{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 646,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33afd1566cc8e810a1cb67a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来最想先做什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde23a6c1d6cdcae5b5b613f74f2a5a1720d0f8f6ca6778aed45bfc9b015ffd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf97a37b1330adfce4142cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们都很期待你的下一场竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c2b5bf48a66a450b4955bae8f9f65457c72ee086eb28afb203f496b11c9f44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6077e0c360cd2cf53ee984a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会聚集更多的强敌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0173c736b29597ea9675e440991360bd7b5c1e269c845501883708661123d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6171cc055c54e9ec4e2412",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会针对决赛特地去吃「致胜料理」吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e57567e8face532bb1b30cac81763943187365222b4778a6aaa9b2fbaf16e11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab50834b6c4017c37e3b1e1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请针对决赛说说你的抱负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b8909cb979778ac43ca869bad5125b818db7ce025ce9f9c1d9d1b913373ade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40450ee389864930a95ef9ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练时会特别注重什么吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a466a12127975df8438610b71bd25286a1be4122aa220e3c446cb8911bcc8a13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c87c468cfe12df6f59bf7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你如同子弹般飞奔的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ec2e949a697fdae66244c8c9b59300271cdb34d1a29792f34010c368c23a39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45db6df4ad7ceadf98746134",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和训练员进行了什么样的作战会议？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b81ca5c0db7dcff648dce754ed084a1a57f1ba345912fa943460dd4fa3eb33a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3ecd61c5d5940d1a6cc5a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必接下来的竞赛对手会越来越强吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de076c3a77b5bb699000fef645b19176ffa2b4268886da900709b4ce6aecbe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce527f1b737461c742a96c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一下子就好，可以请你把面罩脱掉吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be0da9d64a32b978b2600ca30c19954b0dec5319a937dce7540263f54d7cdf1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56fb4f206d2cbb860cdca3c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d15f6fdfced58652fbc9e3a2f8e7c128e170e92e9d1e781004a50c8ef3855ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb00fdefbdca97012bfe3213",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来下次也会成为一场热血的对决呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d56fd0bdcd8c1e4e83ca22a11fc5c46c8f274b2624163bfa4b8f50d62a2e7cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1b01f6354139041efe56a40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问成为你致胜关键的料理是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "632f9a50aa74df9680d1e364094117aca8a517ee215de1907cd0159b5fa53a83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c686a9278a1038f06092e03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们在竞赛上吸引众人目光的技巧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb345a2b0e0f7a48b53721d6e41e04b4028119405fa136aaba11b19f0074b5fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e0a9e9e7488b2514f068ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你认为自己与对手们的差别在于？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17e7309c9a98accc24a7161089ea48d7131fbee81a5727ba6aac50efd9a670cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f96ef93f7d1d69b7fd1106",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的表现就宛如捕捉猎物时的猛禽一般……",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ab1b5cfc3ce6f7b84e2e93b6c282e71f53e9b2d6b740684c56e58ebc77b573",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e94fc75f9be50a9c14b9d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也有意见表示期待你们两姐妹在决赛对决喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0350c7ff94863a869d41e60c3794a79bba8d04e724d99b86a6d33ec91096c783",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d969517fae1cd3126f25e01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "抵达终点的那个瞬间，你的脑中在想什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2620f410042760b238f0d13b6e6a2f00b3ff1890359072f173f6420e6f8085ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a7e4492664a2f1a8a051191",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛后，会用什么方式进行保养呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6531b46e1ab2486a6bdcb2ec7a40228d6712ac0b872027e096fdb2d3c87cde4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227fcf1279bb71ba71294cd3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你会中意「怪物」这个别称吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1b7a4e6c757c4a6de377bf1e5ae03a18c16f8132c51149cddffe8e854ca208",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a7c3acedba2f1b4d4d3f0bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你抵达终点瞬间的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c345c2f52b1e6bedfbacee49b896841a12e066f5d700ee76293697e8369d693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc550c00f077cc5731c6d0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下场竞赛该关注的对手是谁？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7f3fa6082c37050ea97c4f82eefd831e1898077521e05a6888656856c71e383",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6149597794119f763fa6c44a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有什么决定性的致胜手段吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76386eab3f1deb47ba79436098f11c7321b02f84793698c242e866a8bd6c1e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df8824542ea62bdec9ddb76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那压倒性的表现，真是令人畏惧的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e61bc0d35f6292808278b34431ac989eddd2def445886b208d0b11e59d5c8fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7764247fe918a775481f2a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这正是能配得上「女帝」之名的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ffb3df7d1b5c7f8305b0438c55acd7b7514281ac23c56dd1ee7949b2e129111",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4663d7a0f59b177a296b8578",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对数度激烈交锋的竞赛对手说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b3ba8ccaa0b61b20bec13e3d086ebe973e78491adc5e23e4ee6a904ac6418c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dc7d54bdcbf9c28f783791c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每天都会做哪些训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a4ce6f6d1a92737e34d53ae6232dda266bfac6b6a0fca96f73e69f7a6110cb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb1e380f10ccfd95037e742",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下场竞赛来临前，打算怎么度过？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad870105e8331346fbb5865f200d66a0322266c3363dd5d1e527a6cb7e9a718",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c53570c45a89036a8b337ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1398b3629ec121af8bef36cb0d63fda7a0ddfc5fdf5ca6d5c069bc57053bd1cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a154fdc222d14cdd7a454871",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你在竞赛前好像默念了些什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d91d0fb3df35a6c0f9219143ef65469741010fdf3362b932146e3a01c118bb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166d3dc2d932089a6d534b89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的目光都集中在你的精彩表现上呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "515138b19e0e701bebb40418a0150f691296abfdfdf4609a0f5cc772998e40f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc524b2d39d9c76f7338ebed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d9484660aa9d08215a9e7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问致胜关键是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "99bc62e29330fa24ded2717da2ea26d66745fd0e4da36cb75f03eaf0d201faeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50531530386416238f70157b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「白色雷电」……的表现，还能继续期待吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "150ff6806b852379e562d2eb5969c70d4d3067aa8a3393e0018f83cece9af528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1faa5115c775e5ae5c369a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对下场比赛的对手说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aeb4cfb691231007ae78fa8cccf6cca67a6fdeb4a8e1d326c5ceaedf5337834",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70344f6c97be89d3f8f5a4fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有特别注意哪位决赛时的对手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d87f6885dd99f1ac2f95c0f9265b852e851a76b1df3d5dd1d9877cb788dabd0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01ca4636c82c300bdf136aa3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛前有做些什么来祈求好运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3f925d00357a8663971a655bb115703222336f2c0cf3b0b7a3c5a1af4407c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca41bddee57d55fbe05b656",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会想将这次的胜利传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3aacf7bd22d81aedb86e65ffa6085109bbf8dbd7b49e803fc91b716666e2f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e407cee9d5151382f0e0be5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃哪种特殊的拉面来庆祝胜利？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e9dbdc5cd49140f57207b362ddf42373f95a4bad9524df1dae8ce9a55409cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c307e9bd4c37306f06b502d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好像很喜欢吃香蕉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28259137bccb4c5039f3cab1b271cbfb35e658ae91d2bce54b9d425930e78233",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b84d54c8e50dcba36aff0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4120d78fbf1092e6b2fafd181fece9e0af0ec5b78238248d9a4228d438d3c77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6523fc6c64fbb6fc78ae980",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛中让眼镜不会掉下来的秘诀是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff27cbc7ce4f3cedc6abf5bf80407ec83ea0e35e60e81beddd52847f5df6f96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1f8a0f59c1ac0180935318",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关于这次的竞赛，有什么话想对妹妹说？",
      "source_fingerprint": "549ac9b606078c25dbf0d7c127dae9589b2e7461820ce853643ec0bf2de5509d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1c512e8d537c5d6c435a84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会有更激烈的战况吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54192323b34dd03631c7adf492e0fbd97767cc9c5f670cd065dbb161487fccb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f50c4899af87fdeef6d0ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对下场比赛，你现在的状态如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0083137408c9fa8073bfb8dbed5b8376520717be4d0776270e13367f40a0d8d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca5cc3da262925c684d879ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得决赛的胜算有多少……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36bbb197db1329cc40aed505c3c2cea7f2d2644ae2a30b008613c958d2572d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8955da248b84768059d425b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请直白地告诉我们，获胜的原因是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37952da99db907b3cd5d5212b8d1f61abc28842a3ef4d6389d6b653d27e38b85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce532890f7714971d4b0c7f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做了什么样的准备来面对下场比赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d4fa2e898a3d5b686c00b97a80c208998f7ca64e97d3e909ad0b2b7b2489a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5679e487c3e70bfa87ef6284",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "脑中已经有获得优胜时的印象了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e251e9e32f41c7c5d2084709545c95d817f23d9925171809e6ee906b0ba6f1d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90cfb28814b0c1638550a2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前会补充什么样的燃料？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54865f4e0412e46e314efe1cb704436be35bb8a17ca0eb7063577f4bc8b61a76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0f146cb3fc828dcd5e0ad7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好惊人的表现……难道你真的是赛博格？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f97cf01b36e72854e42f041fcdcf148b4da9a301fcea47e81f8d17682a0e5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db4ab171e3395887d0c12e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请让我们拍一张庆祝胜利的特写！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b19c748b84e8896026cc4a7c8dab46959f4ea45dd50cf6370fe67518e6b4faf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edb97e933b6f92d1d986769",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如同「超特急」般的表现太精彩了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328f722939c2093fa199533ad74fc83ff0f427aed3181f6c0cf513d7cfb16286",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18601ca60de567371732e84f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有预计会针对决赛来强化自己吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f91c8299afd411ac423daaacf584107d22c2ccfb0b61bb8af0b59a47ea42f130",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05af3726889c045593f2c72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是场相当激烈的竞赛，会感到疲累吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a67709e660f842b043741daec8a8186a74793c14db36e0cbd2ae589727823c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:993b2adfc25103e1f61c5e38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对下场比赛的劲敌们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32610bcce81c51c76c2c3dde0f2756e73043920658f8d1a42093c69129a5d14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350d10e0ab0f8a3bb3dc4b72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是看了就令人为之兴奋的震撼表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16314c9b40caa07c537fdaf61b0ed2d2e821adca3d982f74f543dafba9ac93a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e439be51572094ec4b5ebe8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你为了大赛下了特别的工夫！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786f71f49445bef2c469d4ad7875c8eba7a99e37ada7b84d9060e52d05094bac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72605b4c1e9f73c16fd4d494",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70724cf0f51fa4c7fe5ab657",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是相当耀眼的精彩表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c49463d42c532d51e5f057a654d3f329d6e43931a1de0a191d6d3f26d2711267",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f23092e9fce493f6e7eb98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛时似乎会遇到更强的对手喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "242583cf602fa044fbe1fc74fedbc71f67ac77d643e8d9a2fc34b70e0b0aa693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c79cd268bf4a33a2b1a60ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你刚才似乎跟观众席的人说了些什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b43e2c74ae055b31125d1c3e876c0a6c3eb9a3a955af61a5a278aea98c409c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "239"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e228f89f9465fa3302f011c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对看完比赛的后辈赛马娘说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe117e9a77668239d0ba68c7773b2ea3b63d211371e58c24b87497c22313458",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac591e965c567011cf16cf7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛时也能期待你的表现对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "322b3540860ca3ff963115fa1a84318df86fec4cef78756387bf0d6636883420",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "240"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa926f6c6fba48c59838c5e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问你是以什么样的心情面对竞赛呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6133b20bd3e3181212803df5b57a1e9cea595b36fbc5589ffc166b34b17e632d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdad24fceb6ae79500394676",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的致胜料理果然是会吃饭吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bae6f9927ac2b654356259a7e56fcfa1609e63956c9a9dcf27c54479e3614c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12195471b5302909607faf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以让我们拍一张获胜的纪念照吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c38d61352e60487369c3d567b0ade3fa6461668b0381448dbf6b6938af60ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a962fd9b633be43b203fa73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对决赛时的压力会很大吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b548b7412c5410c52bc6f937df33a1aabd8ada6f0f215cdfb07224da096a17bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47932605434fcef2c16cce1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对决赛的劲敌发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "074544c32f79f0321e54dacf6cdc398fad3c8cb22f4fea039e7e30b3bab79ebd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "245"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e44e17a1f6f61aa39da369d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对于下场比赛的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fede3e3f600c7943b09f52e254b414d137badde58a6fbc81f60a2449102055a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:259e2a908168c925c60c18a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
